   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n  <li>Mai and Jada are solving the equation <span data-math=\"2x^2−7x=15\">2x^2−7x=15</span> using the quadratic formula.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Answer the following questions about the values of <span data-math=\"a\">a</span>, <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>, and <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> if this equation is written in standard form, <span data-math=\"ax^2+bx+c=0\">ax^2+bx+c=0</span>.</p>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>What is the value of <span data-math=\"a\">a</span>?</li>\n</ol>",
