   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\" start=\"4\">\n  <li>Mai and Jada are solving the equation <span data-math=\"2x^2−7x=15\">2x^2−7x=15</span> using the quadratic formula but found different solutions.</li>\n</ol><br>  <table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Mai's Method</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Jada's Method</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{7^2-4(2)(-15)}}{2(2)}\">x=\\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{7^2-4(2)(-15)}}{2(2)}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{49-(-120)}}{4}\">x=\\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{49-(-120)}}{4}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{169}}{4}\">x=\\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{169}}{4}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-7 \\pm 13}{4}\">x=\\frac{-7 \\pm 13}{4}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-7+13}{4}=\\frac{6}{4}=\\frac{3}{2}\">x=\\frac{-7+13}{4}=\\frac{6}{4}=\\frac{3}{2}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-7-13}{4}=\\frac{-20}{4}=-5\">x=\\frac{-7-13}{4}=\\frac{-20}{4}=-5</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-(-7) \\pm \\sqrt{(-7)^2-4(2)(-15)}}{2(2)}\">x=\\frac{-(-7) \\pm \\sqrt{(-7)^2-4(2)(-15)}}{2(2)}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{7 \\pm \\sqrt{49-(-120)}}{4}\">x=\\frac{7 \\pm \\sqrt{49-(-120)}}{4}</span> <br>                  <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{7 \\pm \\sqrt{71}}{4}\">x=\\frac{7 \\pm \\sqrt{71}}{4}</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Who has the correct solution?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1334291,
     "content_html": "Mai"
    },
    {
     "id": 1334292,
     "content_html": "Jada"
    },
    {
     "id": 1334293,
     "content_html": "Both of them"
    },
    {
     "id": 1334294,
     "content_html": "Neither one"
    }
